#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Added extensibility hooks (<code>vmcf7_loaded</code>, "
"<code>vmcf7_validation_tag_types</code>)"
msgstr ""
"Добавлены хуки расширяемости (<code>vmcf7_loaded</code>, "
